      "content": "First, you need to cool the burn immediately with cold water for at least 10 minutes. Then, gently clean the area with soap and water. Apply a thin layer of honey directly to the burn to help with healing and prevent infection. Tea tree oil and butter are not recommended; they can cause further irritation and possibly worsen the condition. If the pain is unbearable, you can take a dose of ibuprofen, but only if you're not allergic. Remember, I'm here to help you, but this is a serious injury, so please seek medical attention if the symptoms persist or worsen.",
